\u00e4ltetechnik) spielerisch entdecken und erste berufstypische Aufgaben ausprobieren. Ob Technik, Gesundheit oder Handwerk \u2013 finde heraus, was dir am meisten Spa\u00df macht! :)\n\nEarly Access: Sei unter den Ersten, die jobVRiety testen!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "CoverImageSafeAreaTemplateLandscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "3902217326706597", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393450_3902217330039930_1240378813803928232_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MOT_VuDZ2LEQ7kNvwFurJce&_nc_oc=AdoyVQrRpQrVkf_g6AmxNbhnTr1TLSW-H_PgfMc_8QRjtXVKZubUtyT7NAk7h61qRn0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQNKpyafSrrvO3FCjgOwmGQgLajlQoJjASJzqkR-JgDVA&oe=6B0B41B6"}, {"file_name": "CoverImageSafeAreaTemplateLandscape_1080x360.png", "id": "3076099412552471", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825091_3076099415885804_5417180118801740963_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dQnAuwW4M_4Q7kNvwGAS-pn&_nc_oc=AdooX5uHvIdrIi6SMbiKfyVad7dDOKb_IhaAMBLo0IaY9QWmiB-TIjjpbBYcLVw4U8Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQB8Z9Up05axoFwxNZB5Wjsjvxnnho57QPyACCqrgdusg&oe=6B0B3DB6"}, {"file_name": "CoverImageSafeAreaTemplateSquare_1440x1440.png", "id": "2448391595528830", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824609_2448391598862163_943533169723644988_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IGzTEbgeQ5kQ7kNvwEwsq8W&_nc_oc=AdpS16Ud7zCvaYjSIMZzmgIH-5u2adm2xGRp-PCIkyt1KPaY1qaIU75PrKLKRAsPuMU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQvtVQffjpFykB6VlsUeeAIj1amqsLRFQVu9ac-_ayv1Q&oe=6B0B423E"}, {"file_name": "JobVR_LogoClaim_rgb.png", "id": "1748084809102207", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "u